#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1188
msgid "The file formats which Gnumeric can write."
msgstr "Filformat som Gnumeric kan skriva."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1190
msgid ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> can write files in several formats used "
"by other programs. The details of these formats are provided in <xref "
"linkend=\"sect-file-formats\"/> and the name of each file type in the table "
"below skips to the appropriate section of <xref linkend=\"sect-file-"
"formats\"/>. The creation of files which consist of structured text is "
"described in <xref linkend=\"sect-file-textExport\"/>. The creation of "
"PostScript and Portable Document Format (PDF) files is done through the "
"printing mechanism and is described in <xref linkend=\"chapter-"
"printing\"/>.<application>Gnumeric</application> can also export text data "
"or HTML and XHTML tables through the clipboard mechanism, as is explained in"
" <xref linkend=\"sect-movecopy-xclipboard\"/>."
msgstr ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> kan spara filer i flera format som "
"används av andra program. En beskrivning av formaten finns i <xref "
"linkend=\"sect-file-formats\"/>. Filtyperna i tabellen nedan länkar till "
"motsvarande avsnitt i <xref linkend=\"sect-file-formats\"/>. I <xref "
"linkend=\"sect-file-textExport\"/> beskrivs hur du skapar strukturerade "
"textfiler. PostScript- och PDF-filer skapas via utskriftsfunktionen, som "
"beskrivs i <xref linkend=\"chapter-printing\"/>. "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> kan även exportera textdata och HTML- "
"eller XHTML-tabeller via urklippet, enligt <xref linkend=\"sect-movecopy-"
"xclipboard\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1208
msgid ""
"Most of these formats are provided by plugins, which are independent, "
"configurable modules. If a format described below does not appear in the "
"<interface>File Save</interface> dialog, this may be because the appropriate"
" plugin has not been configured or started. This can be verified by "
"examining the list of plugins which are currently running in the "
"<interface>Plugin Manager</interface> dialog."
msgstr ""
"De flesta formaten tillhandahålls av insticksmoduler, som är fristående och "
"konfigurerbara. Om ett format som beskrivs nedan inte visas i dialogrutan "
"<interface>Spara fil</interface> kan det bero på att motsvarande "
"insticksmodul inte har konfigurerats eller startats. Kontrollera detta i "
"dialogrutan <interface>Insticksmodulhanteraren</interface>, där du ser vilka"
" insticksmoduler som körs."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1232
msgid "The file formats which <application>Gnumeric</application> can create."
msgstr "Filformat som <application>Gnumeric</application> kan skapa."
